      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FURY'S RAGE (5) settled midfield in the run and boxed on to finish there when 4th (23.11) at Warragul. Can make amends. MOTORSPORT (3) drew a squeeze box and was game in defeat when a close second, 2 lengths from the winner Dr. Hopper (30.04) at Sandown. Bold showing expected. BELLY RUBS (1) jumped from the inside and boxed on well to finish third last time, beaten 1.5 lengths (22.45) behind Figure Of Speech at this track. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Expected to be in this for a long way. I'M HONEY (6) racing over this distance brings the best out in her.",
